  "html": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"601\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/df-1024x601.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/df-1024x601.jpg 1024w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/df-300x176.jpg 300w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/df-768x451.jpg 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/df.jpg 1199w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2> 温馨之家 跨越社区</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"video\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/HYi3FqrWUNY\" title=\"YouTube video\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"accelerometer; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>在這裡，我們用真心陪伴每一位長輩。\n我们具有\n<br>✔️ 專業醫師護士團隊\n<br>✔️ 舒適溫馨的環境\n<br>✔️ 多彩豐富的康樂課程\n<br>讓長輩每天都能安心、健康、快樂，是你的第二個家園。\n✨ 活力樂齡園地，快樂每一天！ ✨\n<br>在我們的老人服務中心，您將了解：舞蹈、太極、書法、手工美術、英語會話課程等等\n\n<br>同齡朋友相互支持交流 讓每一天都充滿笑聲與活力，找到屬於樂齡者的精采人生！溫馨之家長者關懷中心提供：\n<br>• 專業醫護照料\n<br>• 復健治療與健康檢測\n<br>• 個人化日間照顧方案\n<br>讓您的家人獲得最周全的守護，讓您 放心託付，安心過一天！</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<hr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5><span>我在樱花下，遇见温馨之家</span></h5>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6><strong>「橄欖樹基金會溫馨之家」 將為您特約醫務人員駐守現場，為您解答各種醫療健康的疑慮，並護航您的交誼活動和健康動態！ 我们的</strong><strong>活動內容： 醫療健康講座、健身運動、烹調菜譜分享、花藝班、書法班、種菜、棋藝交誼、品茶聊天交誼、文藝歌唱活動、英語會話班。。。。等等</strong></h6>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-3\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><span><span>專題</span></span></h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>不老學園<br>--健康专题</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<hr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/d2a74e9458e75345d1ae289ab44cb905-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/d2a74e9458e75345d1ae289ab44cb905-scaled.jpg 2560w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/d2a74e9458e75345d1ae289ab44cb905-300x225.jpg 300w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/d2a74e9458e75345d1ae289ab44cb905-1024x768.jpg 1024w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/d2a74e9458e75345d1ae289ab44cb905-768x576.jpg 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/d2a74e9458e75345d1ae289ab44cb905-1536x1152.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6><strong>1. 長壽從「動」開始 —— 適合長者的科學運動</strong><br><strong>2. 吃得健康，活得精彩 —— 長者營養與飲食秘訣</strong><br><strong>3. 三高管理一點通 —— 血壓、血糖、血脂如何控制</strong><br><strong>4. 記憶力不打折 —— 預防失智症的小妙招</strong><br><strong>5. 心臟要護好 —— 遠離心肌梗塞與中風</strong></h6>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6><strong>6. 睡得香，精神好 —— 改善睡眠品質的方法</strong><br><strong>7. 骨骼與關節保養 —— 防跌倒、防骨質疏鬆</strong><br><strong>8. 笑口常開 —— 長者心理健康與情緒調適</strong><br><strong>9. 用藥要聰明 —— 常見藥物的安全使用</strong><br><strong>10. 社交是良藥 —— 興趣活動延緩衰老、提升幸福感</strong></h6>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-conten