t<p>快乐的互帮互助</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/f8dcd1a59a44aac31d636065432cc262-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/f8dcd1a59a44aac31d636065432cc262-768x1024.jpg 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/f8dcd1a59a44aac31d636065432cc262-225x300.jpg 225w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/f8dcd1a59a44aac31d636065432cc262-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/f8dcd1a59a44aac31d636065432cc262.jpg 1279w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>06</figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>社交与活动兼顾</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"663\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/tchinese-663x1024.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/tchinese-663x1024.png 663w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/tchinese-194x300.png 194w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/tchinese-768x1187.png 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/tchinese-994x1536.png 994w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2025/09/tchinese.png 1294w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 663px) 100vw, 663px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>07</figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>医疗支援和专业的支持</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\